From a813cfec29d9112c9b48b6be366bcee43d48053c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Ramprasad <ramprasadgoud34@gmail.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Oct 2026 15:40:37 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/8] feat(contracts): pledge receipts and loans for vehicles,
 land papers and jewellery sets

One non-fungible receipt per bank-appraised item, hashes only on chain. Moves
only with a one-shot bank approval or through a trusted lien mover. Bank can
freeze; value drops to zero past re-appraisal. PledgeLoan lends from the
lien-holding bank's pot with haircut plus LTV per asset class and no term past
the re-appraisal date.
